Yamabuki High School
Entrance Exam Site

00:00:50.720 --> 00:00:51.860
Good morning, Yunocchi.

00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:53.290
Good morning, Miya-chan.

00:00:55.130 --> 00:00:57.160
There sure are a lot of exam students.

00:00:57.160 --> 00:00:58.000
Yeah...

00:00:58.000 --> 00:00:59.990
I want all of them to do well.

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:06.710
It sure became quiet outside.

00:01:06.710 --> 00:01:08.470
The exams probably started.

00:01:09.670 --> 00:01:11.810
I'm getting kind of nervous.

00:01:11.810 --> 00:01:13.080
You?

00:01:13.080 --> 00:01:16.150
I was thinking back on when
I took the entrance exams.

00:01:16.150 --> 00:01:18.980
It's unforgettable, isn't it?

00:01:18.980 --> 00:01:21.790
I was nervous from the day before the exam.

00:01:21.790 --> 00:01:23.360
You too?

00:01:23.360 --> 00:01:29.530
Well, all of the other exam students at the
test site seemed smarter than me.

00:01:29.530 --> 00:01:32.290
I was pretty worried too.

00:01:33.130 --> 00:01:36.070
Isn't it great that Chika finished
her entrance exams?

00:01:36.070 --> 00:01:37.440
Huh?

00:01:37.440 --> 00:01:39.560
Chika worked really hard, didn't she?

00:01:41.470 --> 00:01:42.600
Yeah...

00:01:43.610 --> 00:01:46.710
But she's relaxed since she got accepted.

00:01:46.710 --> 00:01:49.380
Right now, she's lazing around doing nothing.

00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:51.140
For now, why not?

00:01:51.350 --> 00:01:52.480
Yeah...

00:01:54.590 --> 00:01:55.420
One Message Received

00:01:58.020 --> 00:01:59.020
A text message?

00:01:59.020 --> 00:02:00.620
Yeah, it's from Kiyomi.

00:02:01.960 --> 00:02:02.960
What should we do?

00:02:02.960 --> 00:02:04.230
Accept it!

00:02:04.230 --> 00:02:05.630
Let's go, Yunocchi!

00:02:05.630 --> 00:02:09.260
Wait, Miya-chan, I'm going to
send Kiyomi a response.

00:02:09.530 --> 00:02:11.440
What? What's going on?

00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:12.940
We're going out for a bit.

00:02:12.940 --> 00:02:14.940
We won't be going far. We'll be right back.

00:02:14.940 --> 00:02:16.130
We'll be back!

00:02:23.950 --> 00:02:25.510
Wasshoi! Washoshoi!

00:02:25.750 --> 00:02:28.350
Question, question, question,
question, question mark

00:02:28.350 --> 00:02:31.720
Lazing, lazing, lazing, lazing, lazing about

00:02:31.720 --> 00:02:33.660
What should we do?

00:02:33.660 --> 00:02:38.830
For now, let's just yell "Wasshoi!"

00:02:38.830 --> 00:02:40.370
Wasshoi! Washoshoi!

00:02:40.370 --> 00:02:41.760
Wa! Shoi!

00:02:43.970 --> 00:02:45.440
Wasshoi! Washoshoi!

00:02:47.840 --> 00:02:50.440
My stupidity can't be cured

00:02:50.440 --> 00:02:53.350
